<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-=
family:=B5=C8=CF=DF">Hi guys
<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-=
family:=B5=C8=CF=DF"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-=
family:=B5=C8=CF=DF">According to Christian=A1=AFs found, reading this regi=
ster would make vm hub failed to finish the vm flush request , e.g.: sdma i=
s doing vm flush which first write data to vm_invalidat_req
 and read result from vm_invalidate_ack, but found driver will forever fail=
ed to get the correct value from vm_invalidate_ack if the meantime BIF is r=
eading this CC_RB_BACKEND_DISABLE register.<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-=
family:=B5=C8=CF=DF"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></span></p>
<p class=3D"MsoNormal"><span lang=3D"EN-US" style=3D"font-size:10.5pt;font-=
